 "body": "<p>Robert Martin (aka Uncle Bob) is a programming pioneer and bestselling author of Clean Code. We discuss the prospect of automating programming, spotting and developing coding talent, occupational licensing, quotas, and the elusive sense of style. &nbsp;</p><p>Watch on <a href=\"https://youtu.be/ldTPVd3vO9Q\">YouTube</a>. Listen on <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/13-uncle-bob-the-long-reach-of-code/id1516093381?i=1000500544934\">Apple Podcasts</a>, <a href=\"https://spoti.fi/3pVcr2H\">Spotify</a>, or any other podcast platform.</p><div class=\"embed-video\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ldTPVd3vO9Q?rel=0\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"\" title=\"YouTube video\"></iframe></div><div></div><p>Episode website <a href=\"https://www.dwarkeshpatel.com/p/uncle-bob\">here</a>.<br><br>Listen to his fascinating talk on the future of programming: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ecIWPzGEbFc\">https://youtu.be/ecIWPzGEbFc</a>&nbsp;</p><p>Read his blog about programming: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=http%3A%2F%2Fblog.cleancoder.com%2F&amp;v=ldTPVd3vO9Q&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEszVkw2UERfc1U0NEVWTG1JcmpJX0xaVEdBZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttTUE3bTRCdURmQ2JKQVhacUp6b0M2bVBUYnpGU0g2VVd2RFAyUGJZRl85STllcGhTUXNaN2w2VnQzZnoyTUJ0N1gtQ2RJbndTT2xkY2V6WGVBYzl0MEZ2NmZuQ1B4NlR2cGhiVTBrb0ZZOG1pMmI1MA%3D%3D&amp;event=video_description\">http://blog.cleancoder.com/</a>&nbsp;</p><p>Buy his books on Amazon: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fkindle-dbs%2Fentity%2Fauthor%2FB000APG87E&amp;v=ldTPVd3vO9Q&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXhxaTh2N0N2c0M5WmVydjBaYW96NVRac0txZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuRnJSSi1tczE1TXJ3blgwVm9lZnBMdlFKRUtxVTVtcTd0ay1xMTFwalVZNmhyYWJGd3ZBT2M5OTVObzVQN1pnbDc0OS16QnlCdlVDMGVBTmRzbFc2bFhZS0F6QjhZeHgxeVFFR0Q5Ukh3eVJYNVgyRQ%3D%3D&amp;event=video_description\">https://www.amazon.com/kindle-dbs/ent...</a>&nbsp;</p><h2>Timestamps</h2><p>(<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ldTPVd3vO9Q&amp;list=